19.8.4 Fitting ARIMA models manually: fable methods

fit_arima &lt;- vietnam_train %&gt;%
  model(
    arima200 = ARIMA(Arrivals ~ pdq(2,0,0)),
    sarima210 = ARIMA(Arrivals ~ pdq(2,0,0) + 
                        PDQ(2,1,0))
    )
report(fit_arima)

